{"id":132076427907489,"type":"artist","name":"Gong","artist":null,"year":1966,"weight":31,"info":{"country":"FR","begin":"1966","kind":"Group","similar":["Soft Machine","Steve Hillage","Daevid Allen","Hatfield and the North","Caravan","Magma","Nektar","Gentle Giant","Van der Graaf Generator","National Health"],"disambiguation":"progressive/psychedelic rock band","img":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Gong_2025.jpg?width=500","bio":"A principios de los setenta, los residentes de GONG habitaron una pequeña comuna rústica no muy lejos de Fontainebleau. Allí se pusieron al servicio de la sabiduría y la imaginación del líder del grupo, Daevid ALLEN, un beatnik australiano que se había trasladado a Europa,  ayudando a fundar SOFT MACHINE, y que, cuando las autoridades británicas le habían impedido volver a entrar en el país, se había quedado en Francia con su pareja, Gilli SMYTH.","tags":["Progressive rock","Psychedelic Rock","space rock","psychedelic","Canterbury"]},"works":[{"id":278061142602856,"type":"album","name":"Magick Brother","artist":"Gong","year":1970,"weight":3,"yt":"8Y_rx2PZSn8","src":"musthear","from":{"books":[],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":116078530059197,"name":"RYM Top — Rock — Canterbury Scene","rank":95,"scaruffi":null}],"n_lists":1}},{"id":262487435915763,"type":"album","name":"Camembert Electrique","artist":"Gong","year":1971,"weight":18,"yt":"Z8c-Nl_r9Zs","src":"books,charts,musthear","from":{"books":[{"name":"Scaruffi","title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000 (Piero Scaruffi)"}],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":150689015758751,"name":"Genres only music snobs know about @LadoB","rank":6,"scaruffi":7.0},{"id":65232636722211,"name":"Scaruffi 1970s","rank":309,"scaruffi":7.0},{"id":116078530059197,"name":"RYM Top — Rock — Canterbury Scene","rank":25,"scaruffi":7.0},{"id":185548171992260,"name":"RYM Top — Rock — Psychedelic Rock","rank":168,"scaruffi":7.0}],"n_lists":4}},{"id":33802502335498,"type":"album","name":"Angel's Egg","artist